  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d2ed9a16b1ce6b8458c713e7b1244c69, type: 3}
  m_Name: GemMerchant_Intro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  merchantTextLines:
  - "Ah... so you made it. I wondered if you\u2019d survive the darklings."
  - "Do you see this fire? It\u2019s not just a flame. It\u2019s a bond. A refuge.
    A<slide a=.2> promise.</slide>"
  - <wiggle a=.05 f=2>The Eternal Flame</wiggle>... it ties you, me, and all who
    will come.
  - Here, you can build, strengthen, shape... but it all comes at a cost.  <bounce
    a=.2 f=1.2>Gems</bounce>. Many gems.
  - I can help, of course. Gems can create structures, tools... even uncover secrets
    the shadows fear.
  - But remember this. Without this flame, there is <wave a=.2 f=1.5>nothing</wave>.
    Let it weaken, and so will you.
  - So, do you have something for me? Or will you return stronger... and <wiggle
    a=.15> richer?
  showShopAfterDialog: 1
